| Skill | When to Use |
| :--- | :--- |
| `senior-architect` | For high-level system design, choosing the right patterns, and ensuring scalability. |
| `writing-plans` | When you need a detailed, step-by-step implementation plan before writing code. |
| `executing-plans` | To guide Claude through the precise execution of a pre-approved plan. |
| `subagent-driven-development` | For complex tasks that require splitting work across multiple specialized agents. |

